@startuml
!include ../../diagrams/theme.puml
title AgentRun：一次用户输入内的多轮 Model-Tool Loop（评审提案）
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12

participant "用户轮次用例" as Gateway
participant SessionManager as Session
participant RunRegistry as Run
participant "Flow / Scheduler" as Flow
participant ContextEngine as Context
participant "L2 Runtime\n+ Pi/Python Adapter" as Runtime
participant "L1 PEP / PDP" as Security
participant "LawClaw\nToolRuntimePort" as Tool
participant "L4 Provider / Sandbox" as Provider

Gateway -> Gateway : 用户输入 + sessionId + 幂等键
Gateway -> Session : 读取 SessionSnapshot@expectedVersion
Session --> Gateway : 冻结快照
Gateway -> Run : submitUserTurn(...)
Run --> Gateway : RunAcceptedReceipt

Flow -> Run : 创建 Attempt / claim

loop 直到最终答复、失败、取消或挂起
  Flow -> Context : Session 快照 + Run 转录
  Context --> Flow : ContextFrame
  Flow -> Run : 先提交 InvokeModel(commandId)
  Flow -> Runtime : executeTurn(Frame, ToolDescriptor[])
  Runtime -> Runtime : 单次模型 Turn；归一化私有类型
  Runtime --> Flow : 规范化 ModelCompleted
  Flow -> Run : 提交助手消息与候选

  alt 最终文本，无工具候选
    Flow -> Run : 提交 COMPLETED + outputRef
  else 存在工具候选
    loop 按原始顺序串行处理每个候选
      Flow -> Security : RequestPermission(ActionProposal)
      Security --> Flow : Allow + Permit / Ask / Deny
      alt Allow
        Flow -> Run : 先提交 DispatchTool(commandId, permitRef)
        Flow -> Tool : execute(AuthorizedToolRequest)
        Tool -> Provider : Guard 复核并消费 Permit 后执行
        Provider --> Tool : 规范化 ToolResult
        Tool --> Flow : ToolObserved
        Flow -> Run : 提交工具结果与 effect
      else Ask
        Flow -> Run : SUSPENDED.approval
      else Deny
        Flow -> Run : FAILED；Provider 调用为 0
      end
    end
  end
end

Gateway -> Run : 查询/订阅终态
Run --> Gateway : outputRef / failure / cancellation
Gateway -> Session : 按 transcriptReceipt 追加完整本轮 Delta
Session --> Gateway : Session version + 1 / CAS conflict

note over Runtime,Provider
  Adapter 只映射模型工具描述与候选。
  不允许 Adapter 直接调用 Provider。
end note
@enduml
